          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "http://localhost:8080/v1/api/scan/evm/etherscan"
          },
          "docs": "We provide a subset of Etherscan-like API for EVM-compatible chains. Please refer to the official Etherscan API documentation for details on parameters and responses.\nOfficial Etherscan API Documentation: https://docs.etherscan.io/api-endpoints\nBelow are the API Endpoints we already support.\n- Account Module: balance, balancehistory, txlist, tokentx, tokennfttx, txlistinternal\n- Block Module: getblocknobytime\n- Contract Module: getabi, getsourcecode, getcontractcreation, verifysourcecode, checkv"
        },
