          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "http://localhost:8080/v1/api/scan/evm/logs"
          },
          "docs": "EVM event Logs,returns the event logs from an address. The current maximum limit for the number of results returned through pagination is 10,000. If you require more, please adjust the block_range parameter.\nThis API only supports networks with EVM pallet(frontier or revive)"
